   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Hello mirt community,</p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:16px;display:block;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">I am working on fitting a bifactor (testlet) model using the <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);font-family:berkeleyMono,&quot;berkeleyMono Fallback&quot;,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;font-feature-settings:normal;font-size:0.875em;border-radius:0.3125rem;padding:0px 4px;font-synthesis:none\">bfactor()</span> function in the <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);font-family:berkeleyMono,&quot;berkeleyMono Fallback&quot;,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;font-feature-settings:normal;font-size:0.875em;border-radius:0.3125rem;padding:0px 4px;font-synthesis:none\">mirt</span> package. My dataset includes some items that belong to testlets (specific factors) and some items that should load only on the general factor (i.e., they do not belong to any testlet).</p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:16px;display:block;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">I understand that the <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);font-family:berkeleyMono,&quot;berkeleyMono Fallback&quot;,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;font-feature-settings:normal;font-size:0.875em;border-radius:0.3125rem;padding:0px 4px;font-synthesis:none\">specific</span> argument is used to assign items to testlets by specifying a numeric vector where each number corresponds to a testlet. However, I am unsure about the best way to indicate items that do <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235)\">not</span> belong to any testlet. Should I use 0, NA, or some other way in the <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);font-family:berkeleyMono,&quot;berkeleyMono Fallback&quot;,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;font-feature-settings:normal;font-size:0.875em;border-radius:0.3125rem;padding:0px 4px;font-synthesis:none\">specific</span> vector? Are there any particular considerations or constraints I need to set for these items in the model syntax?</p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:16px;display:block;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Here is a simplified example of my situation:</p><ul style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);list-style-position:initial;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px\">Items 1-4 belong to testlet 1</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px\">Items 5-8 belong to testlet 2</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px\">Items 9-12 do not belong to any testlet and should load only on the general factor</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">I would appreciate any advice or example code on the proper way to specify this in <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);font-family:berkeleyMono,&quot;berkeleyMono Fallback&quot;,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;font-feature-settings:normal;font-size:0.875em;border-radius:0.3125rem;padding:0px 4px;font-synthesis:none\">bfactor()</span>, including how to handle items without testlets in the model definition or parameter constraints.</p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:16px;display:block;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Thank you very much for your help!</p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin-top:16px;display:block;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Best regards,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;font-family:fkGroteskNeue,&quot;fkGroteskNeue Fallback&quot;,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Joe</p>"
